1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:09,225
Opening a shop in an empty street is a mistake, however beautiful the shop. Go where your customers already spend time.

2
00:00:09,920 --> 00:00:20,320
Two platforms done well beat six done badly. Feeds show people what they stop for, finish and share. You cannot trick the algorithm for long.

3
00:00:22,020 --> 00:00:31,320
Organic posts are free, but reach only some of your followers. Paid posts reach exactly the audience you choose, at a cost.

4
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:39,095
Use organic posts to learn what people love. Then put money behind the posts that already work.

5
00:00:39,800 --> 00:00:46,700
Post on a predictable schedule, and for teams, have someone approve posts before they go out.

6
00:00:48,400 --> 00:00:55,725
Social media is a conversation, not a billboard. Reply quickly, ask questions, and thank people.

7
00:00:56,430 --> 00:01:07,855
When someone complains in public: answer fast and politely, do not argue, move the details to a private message, and fix it. Everyone else is watching.

8
00:01:08,550 --> 00:01:14,300
Likes feel good, but sales pay salaries. Measure enquiries and sales.

